			"url": "https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/issues/8939#issuecomment-234067516",
			"summary": "A maintainer posts UX meeting notes: the team, after comparing other editors and favouring Visual Studio's behaviour, agreed Quick Open will reuse or create a preview editor per focused item, Enter pins it, and Esc restores the prior editor. The notes were later edited to drop keeping the last preview on Esc, so cancelling removes a newly created preview unless one existed before.",
